  "description": "The proposal involves the installation of a single wrought iron gate at the entrance to the passageway leading to and from the front lightwell. The gate will incorporate an integrated mesh screen to enhance security. The design and appearance of the new gate will closely replicate the existing wrought iron boundary railings located at street level, ensuring visual continuity and sensitivity to the surrounding context. The gate will be fitted with an FB1 mortice deadlock, consistent with the locking mechanism used on the existing entrance gate to the external staircase descending to the lightwell. Additionally, a push latch will be installed on the internal side of the gate to facilitate unimpeded access when exiting. ",
